---
// Benchmarks & Telemetry Comparison Section inspired by Zed.dev's performance charts
---

<section id="benchmarks" class="relative py-28 md:py-36 px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-[#212c3d] bg-[#0c1017]/40">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div data-anime="reveal" class="text-center mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif tracking-tight text-[#f0f6fc] mb-4">
        <span class="italic">Engineered for</span>
        <span class="font-sans font-bold text-[#38bdf8] px-1">speed</span>,
        <span class="italic">not bloat.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#8b949e] max-w-2xl mx-auto font-sans leading-relaxed">
        Traditional binlog investigation relies on piping massive text output through pagers. Here is how Binsight stacks up against legacy pipelines and enterprise APM agents.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Benchmark Cards Grid -->
    <div data-anime="stagger" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-16">
      <!-- Card 1: Triage Latency -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#2d3b4f] bg-[#11161d] flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-[#38bdf8]/50 transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-[#8b949e] mb-4">
            <span>METRIC: 01</span>
            <span class="text-[#38bdf8] font-semibold" data-counter-target="98.9" data-counter-suffix="% faster" data-counter-decimals="1">98.9% faster</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#f0f6fc] mb-2 font-mono">2GB Binlog Triage</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#8b949e] mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Time required to locate a rogue transaction by GTID or timestamp across 2 GB of binary logs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <!-- Binsight -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-[#f0f6fc] mb-1.5 font-semibold">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#38bdf8]"></span>
                <span>Binsight</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-[#38bdf8]" data-counter-target="1.4" data-counter-suffix="s" data-counter-decimals="1">1.4s</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#161f2c] overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-[#38bdf8] rounded-full" style="width: 4%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- mysqlbinlog | grep -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-[#8b949e] mb-1.5">
              <span>mysqlbinlog | grep</span>
              <span>128.4s</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#161f2c] overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-[#2d3b4f] rounded-full" style="width: 100%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-[#212c3d] text-[11px] text-[#5c6b76]">
            Indexed SQLite position index vs linear disk re-parse.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Memory Footprint -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#2d3b4f] bg-[#11161d] flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-[#3fb950]/50 transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-[#8b949e] mb-4">
            <span>METRIC: 02</span>
            <span class="text-[#3fb950] font-semibold" data-counter-target="24" data-counter-suffix="x lighter">24x lighter</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#f0f6fc] mb-2 font-mono">Memory Footprint</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#8b949e] mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Resident set size (RSS) during active continuous replication stream consumption.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <!-- Binsight -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-[#f0f6fc] mb-1.5 font-semibold">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#3fb950]"></span>
                <span>Binsight (Go)</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-[#3fb950]" data-counter-target="26" data-counter-suffix=" MB">26 MB</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#161f2c] overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-[#3fb950] rounded-full" style="width: 5%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Java/APM Agent -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-[#8b949e] mb-1.5">
              <span>Java / APM Agent</span>
              <span>640 MB+</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#161f2c] overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-[#2d3b4f] rounded-full" style="width: 100%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-[#212c3d] text-[11px] text-[#5c6b76]">
            Zero JVM runtime overhead. Single compiled static binary.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Network Egress & Air-Gap -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#2d3b4f] bg-[#11161d] flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-[#e3b341]/50 transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-[#8b949e] mb-4">
            <span>METRIC: 03</span>
            <span class="text-[#e3b341] font-semibold">100% Air-gapped</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#f0f6fc] mb-2 font-mono">Network Egress</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#8b949e] mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Data volume dispatched to external servers or third-party cloud monitoring endpoints.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <!-- Binsight -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-[#f0f6fc] mb-1.5 font-semibold">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#3fb950]"></span>
                <span>Binsight</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-[#3fb950]">0 KB</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#161f2c] overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-[#3fb950] rounded-full" style="width: 1%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Cloud Observability -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-[#8b949e] mb-1.5">
              <span>Cloud SaaS APM</span>
              <span>Continuous</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#161f2c] overflow-hidden">
              <div class="h-full bg-[#e3b341] rounded-full" style="width: 100%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-[#212c3d] text-[11px] text-[#5c6b76]">
            Localhost only. No external telemetry or telemetry ping.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Callout Banner -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-[#212c3d] bg-[#161f2c]/50 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-[#8b949e]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="text-[#38bdf8]">✓</span>
        <span class="text-[#f0f6fc]">64-bit Monotonic Safe:</span>
        <span>Immune to MySQL 4 GiB binlog offset counter wrap bugs.</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://github.com/adrijshikhar/binsight" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#38bdf8] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
        Inspect Source Architecture &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
